        "question": "What lead times and production support apply to OEM pipe flange programs?",
        "answer": "Prototype timing depends on material, pressure class, size, inspection, and treatment scope. After first-article approval, pilot and blanket-order releases can include SPC, EN 10204, CMM, treatment, and lot-traceability records. Final timing and pricing follow review of the drawing, annual volume, fabrication route, and certification needs."
